{"name":"Socialite","hex":"#907676","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"socialite","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person (often a woman) of social prominence, considered to be an influential figure.","A person who goes to fashionable parties and is often written about in the newspapers, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/socialite"}],"entries":[{"title":"Socialite","blocks":[{"text":"A socialite is a person, typically a woman from a wealthy or aristocratic background, who is prominent in high society. A socialite generally spends a significant amount of time attending various fashionable social gatherings, instead of having traditional employment."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/GeorgianaofDevonshire.jpg/330px-GeorgianaofDevonshire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Socialite","wikidata":"Q512314"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg/250px-Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg/500px-Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg/250px-Boucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABoucher_Marquise_de_Pompadour_1756_detail.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Madame_Recamier_-_Jacques_Louis_David.png/250px-Madame_Recamier_-_Jacques_Louis_David.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser